* Hand-written placeholder op-amp (QtSpice sample; not a vendor model)
* Pins: in+ in- vcc vee out  (matches opamp5.asy SpiceOrder 1-5)
* Ideal-ish: 10Meg input, open-loop gain 100k, 75 ohm output, no poles, no clipping.
.subckt opamp5 inp inn vcc vee out
Rin inp inn 10Meg
E1 int 0 inp inn 100k
Rout int out 75
* Quiescent supply current (also gives the supply pins a connection)
Rq vcc vee 30k
.ends opamp5
